  <item>
    <title>「不确定性」当道，我们阅读的初衷是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62633648b2613e007a25c458</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62633648b2613e007a25c458</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Apr 2022 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们在充满各种不确定性的环境中，通过书籍分享，尝试寻找个体应对环境的更多可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次，我们邀请到了 5 位身处商业洪流中的企业高管，看看他们读了哪些书，在思考哪些问题，包括：当我们回答特别具体的上层问题时，我们需要的底层逻辑；当使用政治家的心态去看待企业的数字化转型时会产生的新发现；企业夯实长期经营根基的方法；战略话题中隐藏的增长秘密以及接受不完美，拥抱真实的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除此之外，在新增长学院的视频号，麻小嘛本人也准备了一份书单，分享了自己阅读的初衷。在「 i 哈评小程序」上，我们也重磅上线了「 i 读书」栏目，由哈评编辑精选书单，并开放试读，首期书单的主题就是「阅读的初衷」，看我们能从阅读中碰撞出哪些能量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们希望这些书籍可以带给你能量与启发，更好地应对周围剧变的环境与持续的内心焦虑，不知道你有没有想要分享的书籍，欢迎在评论区留言，说说你的阅读故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期人物</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span>麻小嘛</span></strong><span>，「哈佛商业评论」中文版 新媒体主编 新增长学院发起人</span><br><span></span><strong><span>陈科</span></strong><span>，安踏集团 COO</span><br><span></span><strong><span>陈世宏</span></strong><span>，麦当劳中国 CIO </span><br><span></span><strong><span>付旭</span></strong><span>，美的集团智能制造研究院院长</span><br><span></span><strong><span>陈志宇</span></strong><span>，麦德龙中国副 CEO</span><br><span></span><strong><span>李一诺</span></strong><span>，一土教育联合创始人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> </span><strong><span>陈科</span></strong><span>：企业是社会的企业，一切始于人，一切忠于人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> </span><strong><span>陈世宏</span></strong><span>：朝代的转型与企业的转型，改革中有着哪些思考与分析？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> </span><strong><span>付旭</span></strong><span>：传奇性丑闻的泡沫破灭给我们带来了哪些启示？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> </span><strong><span>陈志宇</span></strong><span>：常看常新，我们该如何理解战略的本质与其指导原则，并从中吸取经验教训？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> </span><strong><span>李一诺</span></strong><span>：接受不完美，从真实中汲取生命的力量</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong><br><span>陈科推荐：</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35836849/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35836849/"><span>《商业的核心》</span></a><br><span>陈世宏推荐：</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/10434849/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/10434849/"><span>《中国历代政治得失》</span></a><br><span>李一诺推荐：</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35694196/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35694196/"><span>《力量从哪里来》</span></a><br><span>付旭推荐：</span><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Bad-Blood-John-Carreyrou-audiobook/dp/B07BMCMS5L/ref=sr_1_1?keywords=Bad+Blood&amp;qid=1650359237&amp;s=books&amp;sr=1-1" data-url="https://www.amazon.com/Bad-Blood-John-Carreyrou-audiobook/dp/B07BMCMS5L/ref=sr_1_1?keywords=Bad+Blood&amp;qid=1650359237&amp;s=books&amp;sr=1-1"><em><span>Bad Blood: Secrets and Lies in a Silicon Valley Startup</span></em></a><br><span>陈志宇推荐：</span><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Good-Strategy-Bad-Difference-Matters/dp/0307886239" data-url="https://www.amazon.com/Good-Strategy-Bad-Difference-Matters/dp/0307886239"><em><span>Good Strategy Bad Strategy: The Difference and Why It Matters Hardcover – Deckle Edge, July 19, 2011</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>使用音乐</span></strong><br><span></span><a href="https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/4207-perspectives" data-url="https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/4207-perspectives"><span>Perspectives by Kevin MacLeod</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://filmmusic.io/standard-license" data-url="https://filmmusic.io/standard-license"><span>License</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5050-wholesome" data-url="https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5050-wholesome"><span>Wholesome by Kevin MacLeod</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://filmmusic.io/standard-license" data-url="https://filmmusic.io/standard-license"><span>License</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>幕后制作</span></strong><br><span>监制：麻小嘛</span><br><span>后期 &amp; 编辑：Jack</span><br><span>运营：Yao</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于我们</span></strong><br><span>网站：</span><a href="http://www.hbrchina.org" data-url="http://www.hbrchina.org"><span>www.hbrchina.org</span></a><br><span>APP：哈佛商业评论</span><br><span>公众号：哈佛商业评论（ hbrchinese )</span><br><span>本节目由</span><a href="http://www.shengfm.cn/" data-url="http://www.shengfm.cn/"><span>声动活泼</span></a><span>制作播出</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll8vN4SBs1GmfJYhYSZl_SIcYdNs.m4a" length="31358751" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:37</itunes:duration>
